차를 이용하는 학생은 훈련장에 09:00분까지 도착할 것</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">4. 학부별 훈련 일정표</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"></p>\n<table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"top\" width=\"101\" bgcolor=\"#f2f2f2\" height=\"42\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;구분</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">&nbsp;일자</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"52\" bgcolor=\"#f2f2f2\" height=\"42\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">대상</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"416\" bgcolor=\"#f2f2f2\" height=\"42\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">학 급 편 성</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          